      "role": "user",
      "content": "关于论文《Building a Massive Corpus for Named Entity Recognition Using Free Open Data Sources》，Is the dataset completely automatically generated?",
      "turn_id": "7ae715a9f5ed47eeb7079ad38cc23185"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": {
        "claims": [
          {
            "key": "automatic_generation_method",
            "text": "论文提出一种方法，利用 DBpedia 和 Wikipedia 的链接与结构化数据，从公共数据源自动生成 NER 标注数据集。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-04f1fdda9b30597feeeefad5"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "no_human_supervision",
            "text": "作者称其方法是在没有人工监督（human supervision）的情况下构建 NER 标注数据集。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "weakly_supervised_silver",
            "text": "该工作被描述为构建一个大规模弱监督数据集（即银标准语料库），或可归为 silver standard dataset。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"
              },
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-bc9871d99593140a2d7ec03b"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "auxiliary_ner_predictor",
            "text": "与 BIBREF2 相比，该方法使用一个辅助 NER 预测器来捕获缺失的实体，从而获得更密集的标注。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "annotation_sources",
            "text": "数据集的标注来源包括 DBpedia 和辅助 NER 系统，即使未经人工监督，也并非全部由 DBpedia 单一来源产生。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-bc9871d99593140a2d7ec03b"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
